    #
    # The eight are the hole-list store: `vm_map_store_init_ll`, `vm_map_store_lookup_entry_ll`,
    # `vm_map_store_entry_link_ll`, `vm_map_store_entry_unlink_ll`, `first_free_is_valid_ll`,
