    #
    # Preflight clean (`loader_xnu_entry_stub_status=0x90000001`,
    # `high_va_data_verified=0x00000001`), log 301131 bytes, one `stub_hit=` line and no `exception:`
    # line.
    #
    # **Safety:** non-persistent `fastboot boot` only, nothing flashed,
