    # | `.bss` | **24** (0x18 - `OSOrderedSet::gMetaClass`) |
    # | `.init_array` | 4 (`_GLOBAL__sub_I_OSOrderedSet.cpp`) |
    # | definitions / references | 49 / 42 |
