    # **15092** (0x3AF4), `.rodata` 424, `.data` 347, `.bss` **477**, `__DATA,__data` 216,
    # `__DATA,__sysctl_set` 4, an **`.init_array` of 4 bytes**, **181 definitions** and **186 references**.
    #
