                # **OBJDUMP'S OWN COMMENT FIELD IS STRIPPED BEFORE ANY IMMEDIATE IS MATCHED, AND THAT IS
                # THE FIRST DRAFT'S DEFECT TURNED INTO A LINE OF THIS CLAUSE.** `objdump -d` annotates
