                #
                # **AND THIS IS THE FIRST BODY IN THE LADDER WITH NO WRITE TO ANY REGISTER BUT THE
                # WINDOW.** Its device surface is asserted exactly, in program order: the four
                # `RESPONSE` words are NOT read (this body needs one word, and the freshness pair is
                # `0x10` read twice), the `INT_ENABLE 0x34` window is read, written and written back,
                # `INT_STATUS 0x30` is sampled on both sides, `TIMEOUT_CONTROL 0x2E` is read as a
